        <mxCell id="n1" value="Which provider runs?&lt;br&gt;main.ai_engine() constructs one by hand - today ClaudeProvider()&lt;br&gt;(todo in code: an AI factory). That single instance is passed to&lt;br&gt;every preprocessor and agent on page 2.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Model selection&lt;br&gt;  OpenAI, Perplexity: config.MODEL_NAME&lt;br&gt;  Gemini, Azure: model name hardcoded in the provider&lt;br&gt;  Claude: SDK default, signs in with the claude.ai login" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="560" width="560" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1b" value="ClaudeProvider.py - module helper&lt;br&gt;run_async(coro): runs the SDK coroutine with asyncio.run(), or on a&lt;br&gt;dedicated thread with its own Proactor loop when a loop is already&lt;br&gt;running (Spyder / Jupyter).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gemini and Claude also write the transcript to config.CONTEXT_FILE." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="560" width="490" height="140" as="geometry" />
